<BaseLayout title="About PARADOX Tools" description="About PARADOX Tools, a no-account browser utility site for image and PDF jobs.">
<main class="static-page"><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT</div><h1>Useful first.<br>Fancy later.</h1><p>PARADOX Tools exists for the annoying moment when a form rejects a file and you just need the job done.</p><p>The first version focuses on everyday image and PDF utilities that can run locally in a modern browser. That keeps the experience fast, avoids account creation and means the original file does not need to be uploaded to our server.</p><h2>What we build</h2><p>Small, focused tools with direct URLs, clear instructions and no forced signup. Search should take you straight to the answer.</p><h2>Important</h2><p>Application, passport, exam and government requirements can change. Always check the current instructions of the service you are submitting to.</p></main>
</BaseLayout>
